# Findings accepted by the container image scan (.github/workflows/docker.yml, eng/docker/scan-image.sh).
# Policy: see "Container image scan" in CONTRIBUTING.md. Every entry is a finding id followed by an expiry
# date, directly below a comment that justifies it:
#
#   # <why the finding does not apply, or why it cannot be fixed yet>
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# After the expiry date Trivy reports the finding again and the hygiene check fails: re-review it, then
# extend or remove the entry. eng/hygiene/check_trivyignore.py enforces this format.
